<title>USA: Wake Forest, N.C., won by  J.C. Bradford.</title>
<headline>Wake Forest, N.C., won by  J.C. Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford said it won $2.395 million of Wake Forest, N.C., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.67 percent.</p>
</text>
